1789689476671738	rite-dev	itc:v3:AWKZnzMkmSfyTEAAAAAAQbb7arV_VgAAAAEwDg		item.comment	bn-3oml	{"body":"Review requested: cr-2bkg32, workspace: bn-3oml (.maw/workspaces/bn-3oml/). Scope shipped: Claude hooks attach/renew/detach by session_id (workspace commit b565195). Design: the hook attaches kind pull; rite channel must take over that same-agent pull attachment (rite follow-up bone, filed in #rite). Codex: no hooks; launcher owns reserve/attach/detach (documented limit). Per-session bridge dropped: delivery is push-at-send (Codex) and rite channel (Claude)."}	blake3:q51fLAuid8HvKzaCywdrahD3gSaWR6YaRgbO8MxSuQA
